It is entirely in accordance with the Nethack Way for there to be
powerful items which, if used incautiously, can get you into a great
deal of trouble.  Consider the consequences of blasting a nymph with a
wand of striking.

If you can't afford to lose 28 hit points, don't throw Mjollnir without
shock resistance.  But, if you can't afford to lose 28 hit points, why
can you afford to risk letting your enemies obtain such a powerful 
weapon?
